DTP (Dynamic Trunking Protocol):

VTP (VLAN Trunking Protocol): allow cisco switches to dynamically switch their interfaces status (access/trunk) (for trunk it needs to be 2 cisco switches, otherwise
it will be automatically access port). It's enable by default, so technically we dont need to do switchport mode access or switchport mode trunk, but we should
disable it for security purposes.
